### Next steps

**1. Save the file** as `.gitignore` in your project root:
`D:\Documents\CAPSTONE_PROJECT-01\.gitignore`

**2. Add the two trained models to Git LFS:**

```powershell
git add .gitignore .gitattributes

git add ml/crop-recommendation/crop_recommendation_model.joblib
git add ml/disease-detection/disease_model.pth